# irregular_participles.voc — Past participles that do not end in -ado or -ido.
# After 'fora' a past participle makes the pluperfect passive of ser ('fora
# escrita', 'fora posto', 'fora aceite'), so 'fora' is the closed ˈfoɾɐ.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

